    }
    Dan.UAS -> YoYo.Registry 'PUT invitationCreated activity [Activity]' {
        notes'''
          #### PUT invitationCreated activity [Activity]
          >[!NOTE]
          >invitation.test.ts > admin

          >[!IMPORTANT]
          > Auth: Solid OIDC access token as `dan`

          >[!TIP]
          > activity-first (step 1): the RPC writes the activity to the ORG's
          > Activity Registry (actor = the org) and returns a pending ack

          ```http
          PUT https://registry/yoyo/activity/2e9c5aa1-7d3b-4f8b-a6c4-9d0e1f2a3b4c
          Authorization: DPoP eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIs…
