          >[!TIP]
          > validations (all-or-nothing): `Content-Type: application/ld+json` (415); `credentials.agent.webId` present (401 — `UnauthorizedHttpError`); client = requester's UAS (403); `grantedBy === grantee === credentials.agent.webId` (400); requester registered with the owner (403)

          ```http
          POST https://auth/.sai/grants/aHR0cHM6Ly9pZC9hbGljZQ
          Content-Type: application/ld+json
          Authorization: DPoP eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIs…
